  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4324225024
    m_Localized: 'A close-range combat unit designed to close combat and deliver
      a devastating high-voltage shock. Its power cells have limited capacity, requiring
      a brief cooldown period between discharges.

      Notably durable.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765309952
    m_Localized: An autonomous close-range drone programmed for tactical self-destruction.
      Identifies a target, maneuvers into optimal blast radius, and detonates its
      core, dealing a large amount of damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8979902464
    m_Localized: "A versatile ranged support drone. Engages targets from a safe distance
      with charged plasma bursts. Its propulsion system prioritizes repositioning
      over evasion\u2014if threatened, it will retreat to regain optimal firing range.
      Requires a stay at place to charge and fire."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
